WEBVTT

00:12:29.236 --> 00:12:32.773
and you know, Tom, for most of his life,
he was pretty much the embodiment

00:12:32.797 --> 00:12:34.893
of the tormented
contemporary modern artist,

00:12:34.917 --> 00:12:37.220
trying to control and manage and dominate

00:12:37.244 --> 00:12:39.694
these sort of uncontrollable
creative impulses

00:12:39.718 --> 00:12:41.581
that were totally internalized.

00:12:41.605 --> 00:12:43.586
But then he got older, he got calmer,

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.509
and one day he was driving down
the freeway in Los Angeles,

00:12:46.533 --> 00:12:48.445
and this is when it all changed for him.

00:12:48.469 --> 00:12:50.535
And he's speeding along,
and all of a sudden

00:12:50.559 --> 00:12:54.081
he hears this little fragment of melody,

00:12:54.105 --> 00:12:58.110
that comes into his head as inspiration
often comes, elusive and tantalizing,

00:12:58.134 --> 00:13:00.238
and he wants it, it's gorgeous,